> survival. And now I am interested - what is the best choise? (In other
> words - what is harder to get - MC or reflection?). I am gnomish
> healer, 11 exp, after first 10 levels of mines and sokoban, in
> UnNethack.

My personal choice would be to go with the amulet of reflection if I'm
not heavily burdened when I reach the end of sokoban. I've almost
never had a game where I didn't another BoH sooner or later and the
amulet is worth more than an amulet of life saving IMO.

I think doing the castle without MR is manageable and not that risky
and then you got a WoW for a cloak of magic resistance wish.

